{"id":"vod_sn_38489","vodId":"38489","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"百炼霸王与圣约女武神","name_cn":"百炼霸王与圣约女武神","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b8efc4fb164466c5153eb9899828a85e.jpg"},"summary":"周防勇斗（酒井广大 配音）是一个普通的中学二年级学生，不久之前，他的母亲过世了，勇斗因此和父亲之间产生了巨大的误会。一次偶然中，勇斗被传送到了名为“攸格多拉西尔”的异世界中，这个世界正处于战乱年代，各族纷争不断，都在争夺着统治者的宝座。勇斗凭借着自己在现代世界学到的铸铁知识取得了狼族人的信任和认可，一跃成为了领袖人物。　　成熟稳重但有着意外孩子气一面的菲丽希亚（末柄里惠 配音）、对待任何人都十分冷淡的吉可露妮（伊达朱里纱 配音）、聪明可靠的工坊主人茵格莉特（河濑茉希 配音），围绕在勇斗周围的，是这些骁勇善战的女武神们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5jmycpuCHR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fuB2zK69ZU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KutuAurcCp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tLqKhmx18J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BJkpKn9ksi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/14FM4B8pWv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xdWL6rAGHK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/80xFQALZjE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NkjNNkZ3D11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NwN01r0YGS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/93tUZpAUni1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MTkrJWm7Y31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.127Z"}